{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42778807\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"提供PD冻结步态相关的频率特异性EEG振荡活动证据，可作为皮层网络活动与STN神经活动关系的对照，并帮助检验theta与beta振荡的不同机制作用。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42781534\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究康复对FOG患者姿势控制、认知和情绪结局的影响，未涉及STN神经活动或神经网络机制，不能直接回答研究问题。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42788867\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要研究可穿戴设备在真实环境中的步态评估及测量异质性，不涉及FOG相关神经活动或STN机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42823526\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"提供STN-DBS术后FOG、步态及运动恢复的纵向临床证据，并揭示非运动症状对运动恢复的调节作用，可帮助区分STN刺激效应与临床表型的关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42824321\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要评价STN-DBS术后物理活动和康复对一般步态及平衡结局的影响，缺乏FOG特异性神经活动或机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42827691\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"广泛总结PD非药物干预的随机试验证据，未针对STN神经活动与FOG的关系提供可用于机制比较的具体证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42828441\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究认知负荷和双任务启动时序对PD步态的影响，但没有直接测量FOG或STN神经活动，属于间接的步态研究。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42865107\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然提及DBS治疗FOG，但主要讨论药物及康复治疗前景，未提供STN神经活动与FOG关系的具体机制证据或系统性分析。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42931251\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"提出纹状体基质与斑块区多巴胺通路的基底节理论框架，但未涉及FOG或STN活动与冻结步态的联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42957570\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"通过神经影像荟萃分析确定FOG相关右侧额下回异常，为皮层额叶网络参与FOG及其与STN相互作用的竞争性机制提供独立证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42965018\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"系统总结PD定量EEG活动与步态、FOG及神经调控的关系，可用于比较皮层振荡和连接性指标与STN神经活动证据，并分析不同电生理指标结果不一致的可能来源。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42968793\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较STN单靶点与STN-SNr双靶点刺激对FOG的影响，并分析刺激频率的调节作用，为STN相关环路、刺激参数与FOG之间的因果机制提供重要临床证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42983899\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"提出FOG从前驱期、亚临床期到发作期的动态分阶段理论，可帮助解释STN神经活动与FOG关系的时间依赖性及不同研究范式下结果不一致的原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:43010804\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究虚拟现实和足底触觉刺激对FOG及步态的康复效果，虽然提供FOG临床干预数据，但没有涉及STN神经活动或相关神经机制。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1bde9d90-b67c-48f6-8797-a2bf4b59fde3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T140040505814Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.796, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T14:01:39.308525+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d879eb3a2f0802a627d244a619119abd5464e55e22bc7ea859ae2d8275b1fc37", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d